ell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;font-size:14px\">DEPOSITS&nbsp;WILL BE ACCEPTED AFTER&nbsp;MARCH 4TH.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #363636; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;font-size:14px\">California Transfer Tax will be added to the total winning bid amount, and this amount will be shown on the live bidding page.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #363636; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;font-size:14px\">Please do not </span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #363636; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;font-size:14px\">submit your final payment until all fees have been applied and an email has been recieve</span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #363636; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;font-size:14px\">d.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#ff0000;background-color:#ffff00\">*</span><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff0000;background-color:#ffff00\">Final payments can only be paid via Domestic Wire and must be </span><span style=\"color:#ff0000;background-color:#ffff00;text-decoration:underline\">received</span><span style=\"color:#ff0000;background-color:#ffff00\"> no later than Wednesday, March 18th by 5:00pm PST/7:00pm CST.*</span> Please email support&#64;govease.com for Wire Instructions.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #363636; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;text-decoration:underline;font-size:16px\">Ple</span><span style=\"color: #363636; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: #ffffff;text-decoration:underline;font-size:16px\">ase use the links below to view documents for the upcoming Kern County CA tax sale.</span></p><p><a href=\"/uploads/FAQs_20Updated (1).pdf\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Kern County FAQs&nbsp;</span></a></p><p><a href=\"/uploads/GeneralAuctionRulesUpdated.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Kern County General Auction Rules&nbsp;</span></a></p><p><a href=\"/uploads/2026_Kern County Terms of Sale_March.pdf\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Kern County Terms and Conditions</span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>***Vesting Information***&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Bidders will be required to submit an initial Vesting Information form when registering. Winning bidders will have the opportunity to update their Vesting Information at the conclusion of the auction. If the Vesting Information is not updated, the original Vesting Information will be utilized by Kern County.&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>***REFUNDS***</strong></span><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Refunds will take place 7-10 business days after the sale is completely finished. </strong><strong>I</strong><strong><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\" style=\"color: rgba(44,62,80,var(--O42jJQ,1)); caret-color: #2c3e50\">n the event a refund is required, </span></strong><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\" style=\"color: rgba(44,62,80,var(--O42jJQ,1)); caret-color: #2c3e50; font-weight: 700\"><strong>t</strong>hese refunds will automatically be issued to the information filled out on the GovEase Wire Return Bidder Confirmation form.</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">***BIDDING PROCESS***&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><u><strong><span style=\"background-color:#FFFF00\">Once Live Bidding&nbsp;opens, your pre-bids will be placed and they cannot be removed! You can raise your bid on parcels during Live Bidding, and you can bid on new parcels at any time during Live Bidding.&nbsp;But you cannot delete your bid on a parcel during Live Bidding if you are currently winning.</span></strong></u><br /><br />All parcels will open at 8:00am Pacific on Monday, March 9th and will begin closing in 15 minute batches beginning at 8:00am Pacific on Wednesday, March 11</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>th.</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;Each batch will contain 25 parcels, except for the last batch which will contain 10 parcels. This number is subject to change as the result of any list removals.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>If a property is currently taking live bids, there will be a two minute clock reset and the property will not close until all live bidding has ceased. Winners will be finalized by 5:00pm&nbsp;Pacific on Wednesday,&nbsp;</strong><strong>March 11th</strong><strong>.&nbsp;</strong></span></p>&nbsp;</p></span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n<!-- 12/27/2022 - Valery Abregu - GEMP-738 - County Registration Page - Sub Accounts Allowed - Add below Section -->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- 02/08/2023 - Valery Abregu - GEMP-750 - BEGIN -->\r\n<div id=\"divValRegDocs\" class=\" hideIt\" style=\"width:100%;\">\r\n    <div class=\"alert alert-danger mb-1\" style=\"width:80%;text-align:center;margin: 0 auto;\">\r\n        No Bidding Accounts designated for this auction! Please designate at least one bidding account to participate in this auction in order to register.\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 02/08/2023 - Valery Abregu - GEMP-750 - END -->\r\n\r\n<div id=\"panel-registration_forms_and_documents\" class=\"panel\">\r\n    <div class=\"panel-hdr\">\r\n        <h2>\r\n            <span class=\"fw-500\">\r\n                Step 1 - Submit Registration Requirements &nbsp;\r\n                <span class=\"tooltip\">\r\n                    <i class=\"fal fa-question-circle\" style=\"color:#2980b9;\"></i><span class=\"tooltiptextblue tooltip-right\">Once successfully submitted, a green check mark icon will be displayed next to the item name</span>\r\n                </span>\r\n            </span>\r\n        </h2>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"panel-container\">\r\n        <div class=\"panel-content\">\r\n\r\n<form action=\"/PublicPortal/RegistrationDetail?AuctionID=1348&amp;Edit=False/\" method=\"post\"><input name=\"__RequestVerificationToken\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"zjX4evGO4JLCjQP46VpvjplDyth3uuUhX-WrnLkyr3L66JsB6JsWuxFv2a6C0bA1NK4g05cE7QjpzgeXH2jt30jsaOqXlK6vBo9eqJVlIMk1\" /><div